{"name":"안란","description":"오행 대학 불 학부의 우수 졸업생 안란은 언제나 자기 한계를 뛰어넘기 위해 불타오릅니다.","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt29c0e19b94b52ecb/69d6e1158d465d0cc14c5e9a/960_Anran.png","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltad4c1a0ddfe03d0f/69d6e1078d465d09974c5e98/1600_Anran.png","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt9b7863b08388e81f/69d6e0fa369d00815f7d8ccc/2600_Anran.png","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/2c38b41d79a1ce9a08b9ad8eb7edf3ff819bd448af16a5815be8c7fdb7203aa0.png","role":"damage","subrole":"flanker","location":"청두 오행 대학(이전 기록), 감시 기지: 지브롤터(현재)","birthday":"8월 8일","age":22,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"health":250,"armor":0,"total":250},"abilities":[{"name":"주작의 부채","description":"손부채로 불타는 투사체를 발사합니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/b575eb7daebdb64b81b0942c466b00117b31925678d10ab8739781e0ccf1bd69.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt91dec916fce10891/698174c2b521c4021d7390bc/ZhuqueFans.png","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt73593a834a518afe/69864da59fc491c9959a165f/Anran_ZhuqueFans_MP4_GH_01.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt9be43d7bf92d9860/69864d899fc491641e9a165d/Anran_ZhuqueFans_MP4_GH_01.webm"}}},{"name":"불난 데 부채질","description":"뜨거운 돌풍이 화염 피해를 증폭시킵니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/66ed3af8219952edc022c4ef08c65191cdd6839aae0a2c451f70f8f61d2bc7de.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltb74377ee1dcdbe11/698174c2a3d43b34c51f6cb3/FanTheFlames.png","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2